+/**
+ * The Daily Grind — Reusable, Accessible Web Components
+ *
+ * Components:
+ * - <coffee-card>: Encapsulated product card with size selector, favorite toggle,
+ *   expandable tasting/brewing details, and add-to-order action.
+ * - <grind-menu-explorer>: Interactive menu filter & search section wrapping
+ *   <coffee-card> items with live aria announcements and category/roast filtering.
+ * - <grind-order-drawer>: Interactive order summary / quick-order drawer & dialog
+ *   that listens to `coffee-order-add` events across the page.
+ * - <grind-brew-calculator>: Interactive coffee-to-water ratio & roast customizer widget.
+ */
